# Loose items (docs/design/held-and-world-items.md Phase A). scene.js draws
# every item `items` counts, in the raft scene and the streamed one alike.

case a spawned item adds to the raft scene's items
start walk raft
expect items = 3
spawn item seeds
expect items = 4

case a spawned item shows in a streamed world
start walk stream
expect items = 0
spawn item seeds
expect items = 1
